        "text": "**Defining the Target Provider**\n\nI've decided to build this file around Google Cloud's Vertex AI. Now, I need to figure out the best way to represent its model, deployment, or inference resource within the Python code. I am focusing on how to make the external provider identifiable. I'm thinking about how to integrate a provider-specific method into the `select_platform_resource.py` file.\n\n\n**Refining the Resource Resolution**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on the file's structure and the core function. I'm building `select_platform_resource.py` and I've decided to build a concrete example using Vertex AI. I'm focusing on the `select_model_resource` function and how it will initialize the Vertex AI client and fetch a model. The function will take a `project_id` and a `model_id`. The aim is to make the external provider very identifiable via a placeholder model ID.\n\n\n",
