        "text": "**Defining the Implementation**\n\nOkay, I've decided to move forward by focusing on Google Cloud as the external provider. Now, my goal is to figure out the best way to make this integration clear in the `invoke_platform_model.py` file, incorporating the provider specificity.\n\n\n**Refining the Structure**\n\nI'm now concretely focused on Vertex AI and the `google.cloud.aiplatform` SDK. My plan to encapsulate the model invocation is firm, with a function taking project ID, location, model name, and prompt. I'll initialize the Vertex AI client within this function and then make the prediction call. I'll return the response of the model from the function.\n\n\n",
